# Glistening Deluge's "green" is a color word of its text (CR 612.1, 612.2): Bot1 casts it and, holding priority, changes
# it with Sleight of Mind to "black". It resolves as "Creatures that are black and/or white get an additional -2/-2":
# Bot1's green Sentinel of the Nameless City (3/4) gets only the -1/-1 and is a 2/3, and Bot2's black Screeching
# Soulbreaker (1/4) gets -3/-3 and is a -2/1.

